\newlabel{fig:color_tubes_minipage}{{5}{9}{A visualization of our bijection between scalar metric distances $d \geq 0$ and RGB color values in $[0, 1]^3$, which is achieved by curving metric depth with a power transform, and then interpolating along the edges of the color cube according to that curved metric depth. The metric depth values (in meters) corresponding to various RGB colors are overlaid}{figure.caption.7}{}}
