\newlabel{tab:depth}{{3}{10}{Monocular metric depth estimation under the zero-shot transfer setting. Vision Banana achieves superior results on public datasets without using camera intrinsics in neither training of inference. Metrics marked with $\uparrow $ are better if higher; metrics marked with $\downarrow $ are better if lower}{table.caption.8}{}}
